WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.250
In a market full of counterfeits, trust can no longer depend on a label alone.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:14.400
With nexID, every physical product can activate a verifiable digital identity with a simple tap.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.750
The N F C chip responds with a unique cryptographic signature, validated in real time, with no app to install.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:29.100
The consumer unlocks a digital passport: origin, batch, history and product status.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:36.250
For the brand, that creates traceability, fraud prevention and new direct customer channels.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:43.400
For the user, benefits, warranties and exclusive experiences stay connected to its declared digital identity.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:50.550
nexID connects real objects with data, digital ownership and Web three ecosystems in a simple way.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:59.650
nexID. The trust layer for real products in a digital world.
